taras gae hain kisi mard-e-rah-dan ke liye
apne ahbab hi se darte hain
jab sanam kuun khayal-e-bagh hua
kisi ke vada-e-farda ki guftugu hi sahi
vaae nakami phiri bhi to hava ulti phiri
sadqe men na ik murgh-e-giraftar bhi chhoda
hava-e-hijr men jo kuchh tha ab ke khaak hua
ho chala tha jab mujh ko ikhtilaf apne se
tire liye main kahan aaine talash karun
zabt dekho sab ki sun li aur kuchh apni kahi
siikh legi bal ki lena ta-kamar aane to do
jab tak farogh-e-shama hai parvana saath hai
vahi sad-gona ashk-bari hai
ai josh-e-ishq bada-e-mard-azma mujhe
kahun kis se main ki kya hai shab-e-gham buri bala hai
